{"ref":"BDB, חֵ֫שֶׁב","hw":"חֵ֫שֶׁב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫שֶׁב</span></big>  <strong>n.m. ingenious work</strong>, name of the <em>girdle</em> or <em>band</em> of the ephod (<em>cunningly woven band</em>, RV), only P; always in combin., <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ האפ(ו)ד</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:27\" href=\"/Exodus.28.27\">Ex 28:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:28\" href=\"/Exodus.28.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:5\" href=\"/Exodus.29.5\">29:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:20\" href=\"/Exodus.39.20\">39:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:21\" href=\"/Exodus.39.21\">21</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.7\">Lv 8:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אֲפֻדָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:8\" href=\"/Exodus.28.8\">Ex 28:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:5\" href=\"/Exodus.39.5\">39:5</a>.","next":"BDB, חֲשֻׁבָה","prev":"BDB, חָשַׁב"}